  "notes": "Warm paper-toned palette (cream #f3efe6 page, off-white #fffdf8 side columns) with a deep teal primary. Each edit card has a 3px left rule coloured per author (Temi blue, Grandma Funmi purple, You amber), matching coloured names and initial avatars. Diffs use green insertion highlights and red strikethrough deletions on serif text, so the student's writing reads as a document. Anomaly handling is careful: the flagged reading is tinted amber with an ▲ +0.35 g delta, an explanatory row, and 'Ask Grandma' rather than an edit. Ownership is spelled out (lock icon: 'Temi’s section. You can comment, not edit.'), enforcing that the student writes her own hypothesis. Review workflow: per-card 'Mark reviewed' pills, an 'x of 8 reviewed' bar, and Mark all reviewed. By day/By person regroups the list (verified live). Photos are illustrated scale/tub drawings rather than real photos."
